						"base": "2d"
					},
					"usage": "Spit Acid",
					"defaults": [
						{
							"type": "10",
							"modifier": 4
						}
					],
					"usage_notes": "Spit Acid (14): 2d corrosion. Ranged attack (Acc 3, Range 20). Double the actual distance to the target when calculating the range modifier due to the ankheg being nearsighted. Costs 1 FP, takes 1 hour to recharge between two consecutive uses. Can be blocked and dodged, but not parried. While this ability is recharging, the ankheg does not deal follow-up corrosion damage with its bite attack."
				}
			]
